  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: f7d4cbb5895136b46a86c7c41d13082b, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - Nov 13., 1833
  - "\u201CI witnessed this gorgeous spectacle, and was awestruck. The air seemed
    filled with bright descending messengers from the sky.\u201D\r\n-Frederick Douglass\r\n
    \r\n\u201CI heard the deacon\u2019s voice exclaiming \u2018Arise, Abraham, the
    day of judgment has come!\u2019\u201D\r\n-Abraham Lincoln\r\n\n\u201C\u2013The
    Leonid Meteor Storm of 1833 was a rare and spectacular event, with hundreds of
    thousands of meteors lighting up the sky. The next meteor storm of this magnitude
    isn\u2019t expected until the end of this century, when\u2014\u201D\r\n \r\nThe
    end of this century. This year?? When and where? How can I warn people?\r\n"
  StreamingVisuals:
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/1833.png
    LowResAssetPath: Postcards/LOW_RES_1833.png
